  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping Study on Sustainable Growth &amp; Employment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mapping Study on Sustainable Growth &amp; Employment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Den svenska regeringen har beslutat om en ny bist&#xe5;ndsstrategi f&#xf6;r Uganda 2014-2018. Ambassaden kommer att operationalisera strategin och d&#xe4;rmed kr&#xe4;vs en studie som unders&#xf6;ker hur resultaten i strategin kan uppn&#xe5;s p&#xe5; ett kostnadseffektivt s&#xe4;tt. Studien kommer informera pro-aktiva val av partners, insatser och samarbetsformer p&#xe5; grundval av vad som f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas uppn&#xe5;s under strategiperioden 2014-2018.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Government will soon decide on a new results strategy for Uganda and the Embassy will operationalize it. A study to guide the contribution to the prescribed results in the most cost effective way is therefore required. This will inform pro-active choice of partners, interventions &amp; forms of cooperation on the basis of what can be achieved during the strategy period 2014-2018.</narrative>
  </description>
